          "bbox": [
            0.197,
            0.175,
            0.833,
            0.219
          ],
          "content": "c. If you were there to collect this data, how could you do it? Write the steps or process."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.225,
            0.834,
            0.291
          ],
          "content": "4. Roll a die 30 times and record the number you obtain each time. Prepare a frequency distribution table using tally marks. Find the number that appeared:"
